<title>JAPAN: Utoc Express - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Utoc Express - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.80		vs	   20.06</p>
<p> Operating    loss 98 million	 vs	prft 677 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 316 million	 vs	prft 411 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 329 million	 vs	prft 244 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 11.31 yen	  vs     prft 8.39 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Utoc Express Co Ltd is a port-harbour transport and distribution company.</p>
